{
  "kind": "Panel",
  "spec": {
    "id": 26,
    "title": "Instagram posts & Stories",
    "description": "Every post on the account, and every Story the bridge saw while it was up (Type: Story), with its numbers from Instagram. Likes and comments are fresh at each check (${every_instagram}); views, reach, saves and shares are asked per post, for the newest 25 (IG_STATS_POSTS) and as many older ones at each check, so an older post's can be a few hours old. Instagram gives a Story's numbers only for the 24 hours it's up and nothing after, so a Story's are its numbers at the bridge's last check before it went (up to one check early); Stories from before the bridge collected them, or up for less than one check, aren't here. Needs POSTIZ_DB_PASSWORD in the postiz .env: the bridge reads the Instagram channel's token from Postiz's database; without it only the account numbers above are collected. Click a row for that post or Story up close (the Post dashboard): its numbers per day and what it did for the site (a Story is compared with your other Stories). The Sort by and Show dropdowns at the top of the section pick the order and which posts. Follows = people who followed you from that post; Avg watch = how long a Reel was watched on average (Reels only); Replies, Taps (forward, back, to exit or to the next account) and Profile visits are Stories' (Profile visits also posts' where Instagram gives it). Link opens it on Instagram (a Story only while it's up, or from your archive). vs your usual: this post against your other posts on this network, on what the network ranks posts by (hover for why); vs industry: against the published average for this network (hover for the numbers); Sort by \"Doing best first\".",
    "links": [],
    "data": {
      "kind": "QueryGroup",
      "spec": {
        "queries": [
          {
            "kind": "PanelQuery",
            "spec": {
              "query": {
                "kind": "DataQuery",
                "group": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
                "version": "v0",
                "datasource": {
                  "name": "bridge-instagram"
                },
                "spec": {
                  "columns": [
                    {
                      "selector": "time",
                      "text": "Posted",
                      "type": "timestamp_epoch"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "type",
                      "text": "Type",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "caption",
                      "text": "Caption",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "views",
                      "text": "Views",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "reach",
                      "text": "Reach",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "likes",
                      "text": "Likes",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "comments",
                      "text": "Comments",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "shares",
                      "text": "Shares",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "saved",
                      "text": "Saves",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "follows",
                      "text": "Follows",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "avgWatchMs",
                      "text": "Avg watch",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "replies",
                      "text": "Replies",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "navigation",
                      "text": "Taps",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "profileVisits",
                      "text": "Profile visits",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "permalink",
                      "text": "Link",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "ref",
                      "text": "ref",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "posted_ms",
                      "text": "posted_ms",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "perf_label",
                      "text": "vs your usual",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "perf",
                      "text": "Score",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "perf_tip",
                      "text": "perf_tip",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "perf_industry_label",
                      "text": "vs industry",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "perf_industry",
                      "text": "industry_tip",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ],
                  "filters": [],
                  "format": "table",
                  "parser": "backend",
                  "root_selector": "$append($append([], posts[\"${show_instagram}\" = \"all\" or (time >= ${__from} and time <= ${__to})]), stories[\"${show_instagram}\" = \"all\" or (time >= ${__from} and time <= ${__to})])",
                  "source": "url",
                  "type": "json",
                  "url": "http://postiz-ghost-bridge:8080/instagram.json",
                  "url_options": {
                    "data": "",
                    "method": "GET"
                  }
                }
              },
              "refId": "A",
              "hidden": false
            }
          }
        ],
        "transformations": [
          {
            "kind": "Transformation",
            "group": "organize",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "indexByName": {
                  "Posted": 0,
                  "Type": 1,
                  "Caption": 2,
                  "Views": 5,
                  "Reach": 6,
                  "Likes": 7,
                  "Comments": 8,
                  "Shares": 9,
                  "Saves": 10,
                  "Follows": 11,
                  "Avg watch": 12,
                  "Replies": 13,
                  "Taps": 14,
                  "Profile visits": 15,
                  "Link": 16,
                  "ref": 17,
                  "posted_ms": 18,
                  "vs your usual": 3,
                  "Score": 19,
                  "perf_tip": 20,
                  "vs industry": 4,
                  "industry_tip": 21
                },
                "excludeByName": {},
                "renameByName": {}
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "kind": "Transformation",
            "group": "sortBy",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "fields": {},
                "sort": [
                  {
                    "field": "${sort_instagram}",
                    "desc": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "queryOptions": {}
      }
    },
    "vizConfig": {
      "kind": "VizConfig",
      "group": "table",
      "version": "13.0.2",
      "spec": {
        "options": {
          "cellHeight": "sm",
          "showHeader": true
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "value": 0,
                  "color": "green"
                }
              ]
            },
            "color": {
              "mode": "palette-classic"
            },
            "noValue": "\u2013",
            "links": [
              {
                "title": "This post up close: its numbers per day and what it did for the site",
                "url": "/d/puppi3-post?var-network=instagram&var-post=${__data.fields.ref}&from=${__data.fields.posted_ms}&to=now"
              }
            ],
            "custom": {
              "minWidth": 70
            }
          },
          "overrides": [
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "Caption"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "custom.width",
                  "value": 420
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "Link"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "links",
                  "value": [
                    {
                      "targetBlank": true,
                      "title": "Open on Instagram",
                      "url": "${__value.raw}"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "ref"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "custom.hidden",
                  "value": true
                },
                {
                  "id": "custom.hideFrom",
                  "value": {
                    "viz": true,
                    "legend": false,
                    "tooltip": false
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "posted_ms"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "custom.hidden",
                  "value": true
                },
                {
                  "id": "custom.hideFrom",
                  "value": {
                    "viz": true,
                    "legend": false,
                    "tooltip": false
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "Avg watch"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "unit",
                  "value": "ms"
                },
                {
                  "id": "decimals",
                  "value": 1
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "vs your usual"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "mappings",
                  "value": [
                    {
                      "type": "regex",
                      "options": {
                        "pattern": "^Doing great.*",
                        "result": {
                          "color": "green",
                          "index": 0
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "regex",
                      "options": {
                        "pattern": "^Above usual.*",
                        "result": {
                          "color": "light-green",
                          "index": 1
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "regex",
                      "options": {
                        "pattern": "^Below usual.*",
                        "result": {
                          "color": "light-orange",
                          "index": 2
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "regex",
                      "options": {
                        "pattern": "^Well below usual.*",
                        "result": {
                          "color": "orange",
                          "index": 3
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "thresholds",
                  "value": {
                    "mode": "absolute",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "value": null,
                        "color": "transparent"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                  "value": {
                    "type": "color-background",
                    "mode": "basic"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "custom.tooltip.field",
                  "value": "perf_tip"
                },
                {
                  "id": "custom.width",
                  "value": 240
                },
                {
                  "id": "description",
                  "value": "Against your own posts on this network: what it ranks posts by (per person reached), counts at the same age. Hover the cell for why and the industry average."
                },
                {
                  "id": "color",
                  "value": {
                    "mode": "thresholds"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "Score"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "custom.hidden",
                  "value": true
                },
                {
                  "id": "custom.hideFrom",
                  "value": {
                    "viz": true,
                    "legend": false,
                    "tooltip": false
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "perf_tip"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "custom.hidden",
                  "value": true
                },
                {
                  "id": "custom.hideFrom",
                  "value": {
                    "viz": true,
                    "legend": false,
                    "tooltip": false
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "vs industry"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "mappings",
                  "value": [
                    {
                      "type": "regex",
                      "options": {
                        "pattern": "^Well above typical.*",
                        "result": {
                          "color": "green",
                          "index": 0
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "regex",
                      "options": {
                        "pattern": "^Above typical.*",
                        "result": {
                          "color": "light-green",
                          "index": 1
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "regex",
                      "options": {
                        "pattern": "^Below typical.*",
                        "result": {
                          "color": "light-orange",
                          "index": 2
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "regex",
                      "options": {
                        "pattern": "^Well below typical.*",
                        "result": {
                          "color": "orange",
                          "index": 3
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "thresholds",
                  "value": {
                    "mode": "absolute",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "value": null,
                        "color": "transparent"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                  "value": {
                    "type": "color-background",
                    "mode": "basic"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "color",
                  "value": {
                    "mode": "thresholds"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "custom.tooltip.field",
                  "value": "industry_tip"
                },
                {
                  "id": "custom.width",
                  "value": 240
                },
                {
                  "id": "description",
                  "value": "Against the published average for this network (Instagram per person reached, TikTok and YouTube per view, newsletters' click rate). Mostly big brand accounts, so a second opinion. Hover for the numbers."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "industry_tip"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "custom.hidden",
                  "value": true
                },
                {
                  "id": "custom.hideFrom",
                  "value": {
                    "viz": true,
                    "legend": false,
                    "tooltip": false
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
